♪Aquí en mis brazos♪

00:38:49.168 --> 00:38:50.796
♪¿Qué ya pasó?♪

00:38:50.796 --> 00:38:52.432
♪Sintiéndome tan perdida y sintiendo♪

00:38:52.432 --> 00:38:54.345
♪Tantas distracciones♪

00:38:54.345 --> 00:38:55.600
♪Nunca lo imaginé♪

00:38:55.600 --> 00:38:58.073
♪Te quedarías a mi lado♪

00:38:58.896 --> 00:39:00.784
♪Consolando mis penas♪

00:39:02.920 --> 00:39:04.816
♪En las calles de medianoche♪

00:39:04.816 --> 00:39:06.192
