00:40:29.445 --> 00:40:33.296
♪Recuperamos la libertad♪

00:40:33.296 --> 00:40:36.025
♪Si me recuerdas♪

00:40:36.025 --> 00:40:38.864
♪Entonces estoy complacido♪

00:40:51.977 --> 00:40:56.121
